            "description": "Used 2021 Peterbilt 579 for Sale – New Tires, Cummins X-15, Road-Ready!\nStock Number: 1274161 | VIN: 1XPBD49X5MD739091 | Mileage: 491,045 mi \n\nHit the road with confidence in this extra clean 2021 Peterbilt 579, a reliable semi truck built for performance and efficiency. Powered by a 400 HP Cummins X-15 diesel engine and paired with a smooth 12-speed Eaton-Fuller Endurant automatic transmission, this used Peterbilt 579 delivers exceptional power and fuel savings for long hauls or regional routes. With 491,045 miles, this fleet-maintained truck is in top condition and ready to work. \n\nEquipped with 10 brand new 22.5 LP tires on aluminum wheels, this pre-owned Peterbilt 579 ensures maximum road life and reduced maintenance costs. The tandem rear axle setup, Air Ride suspension, 2.79 ratio, and Class 8 GVWR of 52,000 lb (with 12,000 lb front axle weight) provide stability and maneuverability, enhanced by a 186-inch wheelbase and set-back axle configuration. The left-hand drive interior is clean and functional, perfect for solo drivers. \nHighlights of This 2021 Peterbilt 579: \n\n•\tUsed Peterbilt 579 for sale with low 491,045 miles\n•\t400 HP Cummins X-15 engine for powerful, fuel-efficient hauling\n•\t12-speed Endurant transmission for seamless operation\n•\t10 brand new 22.5 LP tires for extended durability\n•\tFleet-maintained, extra clean, and professionally serviced\n•\tTandem axles, Air Ride suspension, and 186-inch wheelbase\n•\tAluminum wheels for a polished, professional look\n\nThis Cummins X-15 semi truck for sale near Dallas is a high-value option for owner-operators or fleets. Contact us today to explore financing options for used commercial trucks or schedule a test drive. Don’t miss this low-mileage Peterbilt 579—it’s ready to roll and won’t last long! \n Price does not include state and local taxes; tags; registration or title fees; dealer-imposed fees, including document preparation, processing or servicing fees, or any optional equipment or upfitting work selected by buyer. Valid while supplies last. Images shown may not reflect actual vehicle.\r\nExhaust: Horizontal",
