            "condition": "New",
            "description": "Dominate the Day: The 2026 International HX520 Daycab Awaits\nAre you ready to elevate your hauling capability and make a bold statement on the road?\nThis is more than just a truck; it’s a commitment to power, durability, and a maximized return on investment. Feast your eyes on this stunning, vibrant red 2026 International HX520 Daycab, a machine engineered from the ground up for severe-duty applications and uncompromising performance.\nThe Power Within: Unmatched Drivetrain\nThis beast is built for heavy lifting and relentless reliability, featuring a robust, performance-matched powertrain:\nEngine: The legendary 525 HP Cummins X15 under the hood delivers massive torque and exceptional fuel efficiency. Known for its reliability and power, this engine ensures you have the muscle needed to conquer any grade or payload.\nTransmission: Take total control with the bulletproof 13-speed Fuller manual transmission. This reliable manual setup is preferred by drivers who demand precise gear selection and rugged longevity, handling the X15's power with ease.\nConfiguration: The daycab configuration is optimized for maximum maneuverability in tight spaces and lighter weight for superior payload capacity, making it perfect for regional hauling, construction, or heavy vocational work.\nBuilt for the Grind, Designed to Impress\nThe HX Series is International's severe-duty flagship, combining brute strength with driver comfort and aesthetics:\nThe Red Advantage: This isn't just paint; it's presence. The striking red finish ensures your operation stands out from the competition, projecting professionalism and power wherever you work.\nSevere Duty Specs: Featuring a reinforced chassis, durable components, and a huck-bolted frame, this truck is designed to withstand the most demanding jobs day after day, minimizing downtime.\nDriver-Centric Cab: Step inside a quiet, intuitive cabin designed for the long haul. With ergonomic controls and superior visibility, your drivers will finish the day feeling less fatigued and more productive.\nCall Rush Truck Centers in Pontoon Beach, IL today! Price does not include state and local taxes; tags; registration or title fees; dealer-imposed fees, including document preparation, processing or servicing fees, or any optional equipment or upfitting work selected by buyer. Valid while supplies last. Images shown may not reflect actual vehicle.\r\nBraketype: AIR\r\nHeadlights: Halogen",
