            "description": "2027 Peterbilt 567 Day Cab \n\nWHITE \nWhite Lightning! Great for any Fleet or Owner Operator! \n\nPowered by a Cummins X-15 Engine with 500 HP 1850 Torque. Paired to the tried and true Eaton Endurant 12 Speed Automated Tranmission. 90 gallon fuel tank on the LH/Drivers side and 80 Gallon Fuel Tank on the RH/Passenger side. Plenty of room for a Wet Kit, PTO or. Weather your application is End Dump, RGN, Detachable Trailer or something else entirely this 589 is a versatile tool that candle pretty much anything you throw at it. Dual Lockers with Separate Dash Controls means this 589 can get you out of the stickiest of situations and give you plenty of tractions on the slipperiest of surfaces. \n\nThe Peterbilt Tractor Model 567 is the look of modern trucking. All the benefits of an aluminum cab structure for long-lasting endurance and ruggedness designed to endure the rigors of dump, logging, construction and the harshest of vocational applications. 7 Inch Chrome Dual Exhaust. This truck features a 3.70 gear ratio, heavyduty driveline with the Peterbilt Air Trac suspension. The dash has all the gauges so monitoring all systems is only a glance away. Don’t hesitate to call or come by Rush Truck Center – Dallas, TX and let one of our sales professionals tell you about any of our Model 567s in inventory as well as the great financing options currently available. Delivery available. Price does not include state and local taxes; tags; registration or title fees; dealer-imposed fees, including document preparation, processing or servicing fees, or any optional equipment or upfitting work selected by buyer. Valid while supplies last. Images shown may not reflect actual vehicle.\r\nBraketype: AIR\r\nHeadlights: Projector\r\nCabToAxleLength: 138\r\nCabToEndOfFrameLength: 193\r\nGrossCombinedWeight: 80000",
