            "description": "This 2020 Western Star 4700 Day Cab is a dependable, work-ready truck that combines rugged durability with proven performance. Powered by a reliable Detroit DD13 diesel engine, this truck delivers the strength, efficiency, and dependability needed for a wide range of hauling applications. With 474,074 miles, it has the proven road experience to demonstrate its reliability while still offering plenty of service life for its next owner. The bold black exterior, signature chrome grille, and heavy-duty Western Star construction give it a professional appearance and the toughness operators expect from one of the industry's most respected truck manufacturers. Designed for regional and local operations, the spacious day cab provides excellent visibility, driver comfort, and easy accessibility for long days on the road. Whether you're an owner-operator looking to expand your business or a fleet seeking a cost-effective addition, this Western Star 4700 offers outstanding value at $41,999. Ready to get to work immediately, this truck is built to handle demanding jobs while delivering the performance and durability Western Star is known for. For more information or to schedule an inspection, call Crows Trucking. Located at 5500 Davidson Rd, Memphis, TN.",
