            "description": "2020 KENWORTH T880 DAY CAB \r\nONE OWNER • CUMMINS X15 500 HP • NEW STEER TIRES\r\n\r\nThis is a very clean, well-maintained Kenworth T880 that is ready to go to work!!\r\n\r\nOne-owner 2020 Kenworth T880 Day Cab with 531,872 total miles\r\n\r\nPowered by the Cummins X15 500 HP and backed by an Eaton 10-speed manual transmission. The truck is equipped with AG400 suspension, 40,000-lb rear axle, 13,200-lb front axle, 3.55 gear ratio and 80,000-lb GCW.\r\n\r\nThe truck for its mileage has a clean, well-kept interior and engine compartment.\r\n\r\n TRUCK SPECS\r\nYear: 2020\r\nMake: Kenworth\r\nModel: T880\r\nBody: Day Cab\r\nMileage: 531,872 miles\r\nEngine: Cummins X15\r\nHorsepower: 500 HP\r\nTransmission: Eaton 10-Speed Manual\r\nGear Ratio: 3.55\r\nSuspension: AG400\r\nFront Axle: 13,200 lbs\r\nRear Axle: 40,000 lbs\r\nGCW: 80,000 lbs\r\nWheelbase: 189\"\r\nWheels: Alcoa Ultra 22.5\"\r\nTires: 22.5\"\r\n\r\n⭐ FEATURES & CONDITION\r\n✔ ONE OWNER\r\n✔ Cummins X15 500 HP\r\n✔ Eaton 10-speed manual\r\n✔ 3.55 gear ratio\r\n✔ AG400 suspension\r\n✔ 40K rear axle\r\n✔ 13.2K front axle\r\n✔ 80,000-lb GCW\r\n✔ Alcoa Ultra wheels\r\n✔ Hankook drive tires\r\n✔ Chrome fuel tanks & steps\r\n✔ Clean engine compartment\r\n✔ Clean, well-kept interior\r\n✔ Cruise control / steering-wheel controls\r\n✔ No warnings / no faults displayed\r\n✔ Ready to work\r\n\r\nThis is a sharp-looking T880 with a strong specification, making it a great option for someone looking for a dependable day cab without the cost of a new truck.\r\n Located in Dunmore PA\r\n\r\nSimilar units also available\r\nSERIOUS INQUIRIES ONLY\r\n\r\nMessage for additional information, additional photos or to schedule a time to inspect the truck.",
